(2.10.2 Unless the rally is a let, a player shall score a point if the opponent fails to make a correct) Tj T*
(return.) Tj T*
(2.10.3 Unless the rally is a let, a player shall score a point if, after the player has made a service or a) Tj T*
(return, the ball touches anything other than the net assembly before being struck by the opponent.) Tj T*
(2.10.4 Unless the rally is a let, a player shall score a point if the ball passes beyond the player's end) Tj T*
