(2.10.5 Unless the rally is a let, a player shall score a point if the opponent's free hand touches the) Tj T*
(playing surface during the rally.) Tj T*
(2.10.6 Unless the rally is a let, a player shall score a point if the opponent, or anything the opponent) Tj T*
(wears or carries, touches the net assembly.) Tj T*
